Id: pass022w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: gen_passwd_sets

The password file contains '+' entries, the old NIS escape, while the
name service is not in 'compat' mode. Outside compat mode those lines
are meaningless at best; at worst they widen access in ways nobody
asked for. Remove the '+' lines, or switch the passwd source to compat
in /etc/nsswitch.conf if NIS netgroups are really in use.
